# The api service builds from the REPOSITORY ROOT so it can see packages/domain, which apps/api
# imports for refund figures, packages/merchant-contracts, the merchant API's contract,
# and packages/public-api-contracts, Pay with Clear's /v1 contract. Keep
# `railway up` uploads small: ship apps/api and the packages it needs, never node_modules.
/*
!/apps
/apps/*
!/apps/api
!/packages
/packages/*
!/packages/domain
!/packages/merchant-contracts
!/packages/public-api-contracts
node_modules
